"body": "A thread with one comment and three replies under it showed as '1 comment' (threads 21807, 21809 and 21803 on the live site), because the count is top-level comments only.\n\n- The data shards now carry `reply_count` beside `comment_count`, taken from the replies already stored with each thread.\n- The feed's number is the two together, in the trending step and on the page.\n- `comment_count` itself is unchanged, so nothing that reads it moves.",
